WEBVTT

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:32.400
(WENDY CHUCKLES)

00:00:32.480 --> 00:00:35.000
Bonnie. That is so clever.

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:38.160
(SCATTING) "Hello, I'm Forky.
Nice to meet you!"

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.000
Well, hello, Forky,
it's nice to meet you.

00:00:40.200 --> 00:00:41.520
I'm Miss Wendy.

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:46.440
Mom! Dad!
Look what I made!

00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:47.880
His name is Forky!

00:00:47.960 --> 00:00:49.360
-(CHUCKLES) Wow!
-That is so cool!

00:00:49.440 --> 00:00:51.200
I finished kindergarten!

00:00:51.560 --> 00:00:52.600
-Uh...
-(INHALES SHARPLY)

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:55.160
No. (STAMMERS)
That was just orientation.

00:00:55.320 --> 00:00:56.760
But for being
such a brave girl,

00:00:56.840 --> 00:00:58.080
we have a surprise for you.

00:00:58.160 --> 00:00:59.160
What is it?

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:00.320
BONNIE'S DAD:
Since school doesn't start

00:01:00.400 --> 00:01:02.880
for another week,
we are going on a road trip!

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.880
BONNIE: Can I bring Forky?
BONNIE'S MOM: 'Course you can!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:06.400
BONNIE: Yay!

00:01:09.280 --> 00:01:10.520
(ZIPS BAG)

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:14.400
And they said I shouldn't
go to school with Bonnie.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.400
We got this kindergarten thing
under control, eh?

00:01:17.840 --> 00:01:20.400
(SCOFFS) I can't believe
I'm talking to a spork.

00:01:20.480 --> 00:01:21.480
(CHUCKLES)

00:01:26.880 --> 00:01:28.480
-(SCREAMS)
-(GASPS)

00:01:29.560 --> 00:01:30.920
Hi, toys!
Bye, toys!

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:33.160
WOODY: Ow.

00:01:34.280 --> 00:01:35.560
(WOODY GRUNTING)

00:01:36.080 --> 00:01:37.080
(TRIXIE GASPS)

00:01:37.160 --> 00:01:38.440
He did go to kindergarten!

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:39.880
-MR. POTATO HEAD: I knew it.
-No, no, no, guys, listen...

00:01:39.960 --> 00:01:40.960
You tryin' to get
Bonnie in trouble?

00:01:41.040 --> 00:01:42.160
No, of course not!

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:43.320
You could have been
confiscated.

00:01:43.400 --> 00:01:45.280
-What does that mean?
-Taken away.

00:01:45.360 --> 00:01:46.560
-(GASPS) No!
-Or worse.

00:01:46.640 --> 00:01:47.640
You could've been lost!

00:01:47.800 --> 00:01:48.800
No, no, no, guys, listen.

00:01:48.960 --> 00:01:50.520
Bonnie had a great day
in class...

00:01:50.680 --> 00:01:51.880
and we're going
on a road trip.

00:01:52.040 --> 00:01:53.360
-Road trip?
-Vacation!

00:01:53.520 --> 00:01:54.600
Yee-haw!

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:56.400
But then something
really weird happened.

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:58.160
Bonnie made a friend in class.

00:01:58.320 --> 00:01:59.320
What a kid.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.480
Oh, she's already
making friends.

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:03.480
No, no. She literally made
a new friend.

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:05.520
Hey, it's okay.

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.720
Come on out. That's it.

00:02:07.800 --> 00:02:09.680
-(FORKY WHIMPERING)
-Come on, there you go.

00:02:09.840 --> 00:02:11.080
(ALL GASPING)

00:02:12.080 --> 00:02:13.920
Come on,
let's get you out of there.

00:02:14.080 --> 00:02:15.440
-You got this.
-(FORKY EXCLAIMS)

00:02:15.520 --> 00:02:17.360
Good. Good.

00:02:17.520 --> 00:02:20.640
Everyone, I want you
to meet Forky.

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:22.360
SLINKY: Golly bob howdy!
MR. POTATO HEAD: Look at that!

00:02:22.440 --> 00:02:24.720
Look how long his arms are!

00:02:24.880 --> 00:02:26.480
-Trash?
-(CHUCKLES) No.

00:02:26.640 --> 00:02:28.520
No, toys.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.600
They're all toys.

00:02:30.680 --> 00:02:32.400
(STUTTERING)

00:02:32.480 --> 00:02:33.840
-Trash?
-No, no, no.

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:35.960
That's the trash.

00:02:36.120 --> 00:02:37.320
These are your friends.

00:02:37.480 --> 00:02:38.920
-ALL: Hi!
-(SCREAMS)

00:02:39.120 --> 00:02:40.400
-(WOODY GASPS)
-Trash!

00:02:40.480 --> 00:02:41.840
-(SHUSHING) No, no, it's okay.
-FORKY: Trash!

00:02:41.920 --> 00:02:43.160
TRIXIE: Woody,
I have a question.

00:02:43.720 --> 00:02:45.040
Um, well, actually,
not just one,

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:46.160
I have all of them.

00:02:46.320 --> 00:02:47.840
I have all the questions.

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:49.360
Uh, why does he want
to go to the trash?

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:50.600
Because he was made
from trash.

00:02:50.680 --> 00:02:51.680
FORKY: Trash!

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:53.240
Look, I know
this is a little strange,

00:02:53.320 --> 00:02:54.480
but you gotta trust me
on this.

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:55.560
FORKY: Trash?

00:02:55.640 --> 00:02:59.320
Forky is the most important
toy to Bonnie right now.

00:02:59.480 --> 00:03:00.560
MR. PRICKLEPANTS: Important?

00:03:00.640 --> 00:03:01.760
He's a spork.

00:03:01.840 --> 00:03:03.520
Yes. Yeah, I know,
but this spork...

00:03:03.720 --> 00:03:05.920
this toy is crucial to Bonnie

00:03:06.000 --> 00:03:08.160
getting adjusted
to kindergarten. Oh.

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:09.360
Woody, aren't you being

00:03:09.480 --> 00:03:10.560
a little dramatic
about all this?

00:03:10.640 --> 00:03:12.080
I know this is new
to everybody...

00:03:12.160 --> 00:03:13.400
but you should see how much

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:14.920
this little guy
means to Bonnie.

00:03:15.080 --> 00:03:17.600
When she started
playing with him...

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:19.800
she had the biggest smile
on her face.

00:03:19.960 --> 00:03:21.120
I wish you could have seen it.

00:03:21.320 --> 00:03:22.360
Bonnie was really upset...

00:03:22.520 --> 00:03:24.080
and I swear,
once she made Forky...

00:03:24.240 --> 00:03:25.800
it was
a complete transformation.

00:03:26.000 --> 00:03:28.080
-Uh, Woody?
-Just a second, Jessie.

00:03:28.240 --> 00:03:31.760
So, we all have to make sure
nothing happens to him.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.680
Something happened to him.

00:03:33.760 --> 00:03:34.960
(FORKY LAUGHING)

00:03:35.200 --> 00:03:36.680
Oh, Chutes and Ladders!

00:03:36.880 --> 00:03:37.880
FORKY: Ah, trash.

00:03:37.960 --> 00:03:39.040
WOODY: No, no, no!
FORKY: No! No!

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:40.400
WOODY: You're a toy now,
Forky! Come on!

00:03:40.480 --> 00:03:41.560
Stop! Stop it!

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:43.120
-Hey! No, no, no! Come on!
-FORKY: Trash!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.360
-Trash! Trash!
-(WOODY GROANS)

00:03:44.440 --> 00:03:46.720
Well, I guess
I'll just babysit him

00:03:46.800 --> 00:03:48.080
till he's used to the room.

00:03:48.160 --> 00:03:49.520
(BONNIE GIGGLING)

00:03:51.640 --> 00:03:52.800
Hmm.

00:03:53.200 --> 00:03:54.320
(GRUNTS)

00:03:55.280 --> 00:03:56.560
Forky?

00:03:56.720 --> 00:03:58.400
Where are you, Forky?

00:03:59.040 --> 00:04:00.120
There you are!

00:04:00.320 --> 00:04:02.280
I thought I'd lost you, silly.

00:04:02.560 --> 00:04:03.760
(BONNIE SCATTING)

00:04:06.400 --> 00:04:07.720
(BONNIE HUMMING)

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:15.640
(WOODY SIGHS)

00:04:16.000 --> 00:04:18.480
No, no, no.
Big girl scary!

00:04:18.640 --> 00:04:21.200
(WHISPERS) Like I said before,
Bonnie's not scary.

00:04:21.360 --> 00:04:23.120
She loves you
and you need to...

00:04:23.200 --> 00:04:24.440
-Ooh.
-(BONNIE MOANING)

00:04:39.760 --> 00:04:40.840
(GASPS)

00:04:40.920 --> 00:04:42.320
-Forky?
-(BONNIE MOANING)

00:04:43.680 --> 00:04:44.840
(FORKY SIGHS DEEPLY)

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.440
-BONNIE'S DAD: Bonnie!
-(GASPS)

00:04:46.800 --> 00:04:47.800
Let's go!

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.160
-Rise and shine!
-(GROANS SOFTLY)

00:04:50.240 --> 00:04:51.920
Who wants to go
on a road trip?

00:04:52.000 --> 00:04:54.480
(GASPS) Me! I'm gonna bring
Dolly, and Buttercup...

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:56.480
and Forky, and...

00:04:56.640 --> 00:04:58.400
Forky? Where are you?

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.880
BONNIE'S DAD: He's gotta be
here somewhere.

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:00.960
BONNIE: Forky?

00:05:02.080 --> 00:05:03.080
Forky!

00:05:03.240 --> 00:05:05.840
Come on. Let's eat some
breakfast and hit the road!

00:05:05.920 --> 00:05:07.440
Let's go, Forky!

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.280
(GROANING)

00:05:12.000 --> 00:05:13.640
BUZZ: Whoa. He's quite
a handful, Woody.

00:05:13.800 --> 00:05:15.360
You need help with him
on the road trip?

00:05:15.560 --> 00:05:18.040
No. No, no. I got it,
I got it. (INHALES DEEPLY)

00:05:18.520 --> 00:05:20.320
We'll just be stuck in an RV.

00:05:20.480 --> 00:05:22.240
He can't get far.
I got this.

00:05:22.440 --> 00:05:23.440
I got it.

00:05:23.560 --> 00:05:25.080
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYING)

00:05:28.000 --> 00:05:29.720
MAN: (SINGING) I can't let you

00:05:30.280 --> 00:05:32.120
I can't let you

00:05:32.520 --> 00:05:35.760
I can't let you
throw yourself away

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:39.320
-I can't let you
-CHORUS: I can't let you

00:05:39.400 --> 00:05:41.440
-I can't let you
-CHORUS: I can't let you

00:05:41.600 --> 00:05:43.560
MAN: I can't let you
throw yourself away

00:05:46.000 --> 00:05:49.280
Don't you want to see
the sun come up each morning?

00:05:49.360 --> 00:05:51.120
(WHIMPERING) No, no!

00:05:51.200 --> 00:05:53.640
Don't you want to see
the sun go down each day?

00:05:55.600 --> 00:05:59.280
Don't you want to see that
little girl that loves you so?

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:01.040
Her heart would break

00:06:01.120 --> 00:06:02.240
FORKY: (LAUGHS) Oh, yeah!

00:06:02.400 --> 00:06:03.760
If you should go

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:06.720
-I can't let you
-CHORUS: I can't let you

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:09.000
-I can't let you
-CHORUS: I can't let you

00:06:09.200 --> 00:06:10.280
I can't let you
throw yourself away

00:06:10.360 --> 00:06:11.400
FORKY: No, no, no!

00:06:12.880 --> 00:06:13.880
No! No! No!

00:06:14.080 --> 00:06:17.000
So it seems to me like you're
never gonna behave yourself

00:06:17.920 --> 00:06:20.640
Since I'm not gonna
do this every day

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:26.960
Come tomorrow, you're gonna
have to save yourself

00:06:27.120 --> 00:06:29.080
Got nothing more to say

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:31.920
You're not listening anyway

00:06:32.080 --> 00:06:34.040
-I can't let you
-CHORUS: I can't let you

00:06:34.200 --> 00:06:36.200
-I can't let you
-CHORUS: I can't let you

00:06:36.280 --> 00:06:37.320
FORKY: (EXCITEDLY)
Trash, here I come!

00:06:37.440 --> 00:06:38.520
I can't let you
throw yourself away

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:39.720
FORKY: Come on.

00:06:41.000 --> 00:06:42.640
I can't let you

00:06:43.520 --> 00:06:45.320
I can't let you

00:06:45.480 --> 00:06:46.640
I can't let you
throw yourself away

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.680
I don't wanna be a toy!

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:52.080
-I can't let you
-CHORUS: I can't let you

00:06:52.280 --> 00:06:54.320
-I can't let you
-CHORUS: I can't let you

00:06:54.480 --> 00:06:58.160
I can't let you
throw yourself away

00:07:06.400 --> 00:07:07.600
(MOANING SOFTLY)

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:10.920
(SNORING SOFTLY)

